	<string id="st_survival_kit">
		<text>Medical kit "IS-3"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_survival_kit_descr">
		<text>Emergency kit of three immobilizing splints for fractures, sprains and dislocations. The splint is thin aluminium covered with closed-pore insulating foam: no sharp corners, it does not break when bent and can be shaped almost any way, so it fits even complex injuries.\n \n• high-quality product\n• slow use (field kit)\n• used for fractures and dislocations: drag it onto a body part in the status window</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_improvised_splint">
		<text>Improvised splint</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_improvised_splint_descr">
		<text>An improvised splint made from an exoskeleton drive and a bandage. Not as effective as a proper device, but good enough for first aid.\n \n• low-quality product\n• slow use (field kit)\n• used for fractures and dislocations: drag it onto a body part in the status window</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_morphine">
		<text>Morphine syringe</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_morphine_descr">
		<text>Single-use injector for fast pain relief, designed as a field first aid tool for soldiers. Contains a powerful dose of morphine hydrochloride, which acts directly on the central nervous system and effectively suppresses severe physical pain. Inject into the arm or thigh.\n \n• high-quality product\n• fast use (injection)\n• strong analgesic</text>
	</string>
